# Pyramid Level 2 - The Labyrinth of the Bull (biome: pyramid)
# Symbols: % = pyramid wall   . = stone floor   + = start
# Monster spawns: n = minotaur
# Three concentric ring walls, gaps OFFSET so you circle: outer ring opens
# south (15,17), middle ring opens east and west (7,11)/(23,11), inner court opens north and
# south (15,9)/(15,13). Minotaurs walk the rings; the Bull Court holds two.
# THE HIDDEN POCKET: the golden chest sits inside the ring-wall thickness at
# (25,3), entered only from the north outer gallery above it - a suspicious
# one-tile dead end, now actually reachable (on the old map this chest was
# walled solid and could never be opened). Iron chest in the court.
